   "comment": "",
   "content": "Cyberpsychosis is a mental illness caused by an overload of cybernetic augmentations to the body. Those afflicted with cyberpsychosis are known as cyberpsychos, individuals who have existing psychopathic tendencies, enhanced by cybernetics, and as a result have lost their sense of identity as a person, either to themselves or others. They come to view regular people and other living things as weak and inferior. Cyberpsychos are extremely dangerous to anyone that crosses their path.  There is no real cure, though treatment is available. ",
